sequenceDiagram
  participant Molt as molt
  participant Sub as IPC_subscribe
  participant Cmp as rtsp_compressor
  participant Src as video_source
  participant Mon as rtsp_monitor

  Molt->>Sub: subscribe rtsp.event rtsp.status
  Molt->>Cmp: start compressor
  Sub-->>Molt: Started
  Molt->>Mon: open client
  Sub-->>Molt: ClientConnected
  Molt->>Mon: close client
  Sub-->>Molt: ClientDisconnected
  Molt->>Src: kill source
  Sub-->>Molt: SourceLost
  Molt->>Src: restart source
  Sub-->>Molt: SourceRecovered
  Note over Molt,Cmp: ABR fixture plus throttle
  Sub-->>Molt: AbrStepDown then AbrStepUp
  Note over Molt,Cmp: auth fixture
  Sub-->>Molt: AuthChanged
  Sub-->>Molt: Status metrics bitrate fps clients
  Molt->>Cmp: stop
  Sub-->>Molt: Stopped
